===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈswiːti/}}
* {{audio|en|en-us-sweetie.ogg|Audio (US)}}
* {{rhymes|en|iːti}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|often as a term of address}} A person who is much loved.
# A [[sweetheart]].
# A [[fruit]] that is a crossbreed between a [[grapefruit]] and a [[pomelo]], originating in [[Israel]].
# {{lb|en|childish}} A [[sweet]].
#: ''Can I have a box of '''sweeties''' for being a good boy?''

